        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: British author of The Jewel in the Crown source novels, writer of Amédée, or How to Get Rid of It\n- Works: The Jewel in the Crown, Amédée, or How to Get Rid of It\n- Topics: Playwrights, overlapping time periods\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Scott was the British author whose books were adapted into the television series The Jewel in the Crown.\n- Eugène Ionesco wrote Amédée, or How to Get Rid of It.\n- Paul Scott and Eugène Ionesco were both playwrights who lived during overlapping time periods in the 20th century.",
